{
    // EMERITUS
    "Emeritus.Outside.1": "Emeritus is busily guarding the his house from the crab menace! You give him an affectionate pat for his hard work.$1",
    "Emeritus.Outside.2": "Emeritus gives you a big, slobbery kiss. You are now slightly sticky with Pepper Rex saliva. It smells like campfire.$1",
    "Emeritus.Outside.3": "Emeritus is noisily crunching on a crab. Val seems to have passed their crustacean hatred onwards.$1",
    "Emeritus.Outside.4": "Emeritus is slightly damp and covered in sand, which will probably be great for Val's wooden floors.$5",
    "Emeritus.Outside.5": "Emeritus seems to be leading a very happy life, eating crabs, taking naps, and getting affection from anyone who wanders by.$3",
    "Emeritus.Inside.1": "Emeritus looks up at you expectantly, so you give him a little kiss on the snoot. The Pepper Rex wags his tail appreciatively at you!$1",
    "Emeritus.Inside.2": "Emeritus has only nearly burned down The Guild once this week, which is probably a record of some kind.$3",
    "Emeritus.Inside.3": "Emeritus is wiggling side to side, like he's dancing to the beat of his own tunes. Wiggle on, lizard bro.$1",
    "Emeritus.Inside.4": "Emeritus' stuffed dapper ducky is named... Duckie, and he takes excellent care of her. In fact, he seems outright protective.$0",
    "Emeritus.Inside.5": "Emeritus bumps his head against your legs as you approach. He can't hug you, on account of his stumpy legs, but he'll sure try!$1",
